+# Backward from (9,7): (8,7)='.' → not color. backward_run=0. nx=8 '.', nx2=9='B' → backward_ext=1, nx=8 wait no nx=9
+#   Actually after nx=8 is '.'  and nx2=9 is color → backward_ext=1, then nx,ny = nx2,ny2 = (9,7)
+#   Hmm but the loop exits when it hits (9,7)? Let me re-read.
