+print("  Expected: False (it's a live four)")
+
+# Case: cell at left end of an extending _XXX_ where the run continues left of the cell
+# Wait, the cell under check IS in the run. If the run extends further left (backward), then
+# the cell is not at the left end.
+
+# Key case for the bug: cell at left end where the pattern is _X_XX_ with one X then gap then XX.
+# The cell at the leftmost X has forward_run=0 (gap immediately), then forward_ext sees the XX.
+# But the algorithm does NOT continue counting beyond the first ext.
+
+# Algorithm walkthrough at (7,7) of _X_XX_ [B at 7, B at 9,10]:
+# forward_run=0 (gap at 8)
+# nx=8 empty, nx2=9 is color → forward_ext=1, set nx=9
